Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Edit Someone cuts in line,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,smirks, then spills their coffee\Nfive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,minutes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brain says, “Karma.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But did the universe actually keep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,score?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In several Indian religious\Ntraditions, karma
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,means something much deeper than\Ninstant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,payback:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,actions have consequences that can\Nshape
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,future experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes across lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Science can’t confirm a cosmic\Nsystem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that rewards good behavior and\Npunishes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,bad behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there’s a version of karma
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you can see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat people well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and you’re more likely to build
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat them badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and relationships can suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your habits also change the kinds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,of situations you create for\Nyourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And when a rude person gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,perfect instant payback,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that moment is memorable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so it feels meaningful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is karma real? As cosmic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,justice, that’s a matter of\Nbelief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As actions creating consequences,\Nit’s already
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,happening.
